Let me continue fixing the defects. I have read the owner-only module and the registration handler. Now I need to apply the DEF-04 fix to add the owner guard to the `/api/ivx/owner-registration/status` endpoint.

The pattern is: the handler currently uses `json()` (public). I need to add `assertIVXOwnerOnly` guard. Let me look at how other handlers use it.

Looking at hono.ts lines 3985-3987:
```
const { assertIVXOwnerOnly, ownerOnlyJson } = await import('./api/owner-only');
