The cleanest approach: wrap at the route level in hono.ts. Change:
```
app.get('/api/ivx/owner-registration/status', async (context) => handleIVXOwnerRegistrationStatusRequest(context.req.raw));
```
to:
```
app.get('/api/ivx/owner-registration/status', async (context) => {
